<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#172535"><title>Hearthroot Control</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css"></head><body><div class="scene" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><main class="shell"><header class="mast"><div class="kicker">H E A R T H R O O T  ·  P R O J E C T</div><div class="topline"><span class="ornament">✦</span><span>Moonlit Cottage</span></div><h1>Hearthroot<br><em>Control</em></h1><p class="tagline">A quiet place to tend your kernel.</p></header><div class="breathing-space" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="glass status" aria-label="Device information"><div><small>DEVICE</small><strong>POCO X7 Pro</strong><span>rodin</span></div><div class="status-side"><small>INTERFACE</small><strong>Visual preview</strong><span>No kernel changes</span></div></section><section class="glass profiles"><div class="section-heading"><div><small>THE KERNEL GARDEN</small><h2>Choose your path</h2></div><span class="tiny-ornament">❧</span></div><div class="choices" role="group" aria-label="Preview profiles"><button type="button" class="choice selected" data-profile="Native" aria-pressed="true"><span class="sigil">Ⅰ</span><strong>Native</strong><span>Original roots</span></button><button type="button" class="choice" data-profile="Balanced" aria-pressed="false"><span class="sigil">Ⅱ</span><strong>Balanced</strong><span>Gentle harmony</span></button><button type="button" class="choice" data-profile="Experimental" aria-pressed="false"><span class="sigil">Ⅲ</span><strong>Experimental</strong><span>Beyond the grove</span></button></div><div class="notice" role="status" id="preview-status">Native selected for preview. No changes applied.</div></section><footer><span>✧ &nbsp; Grown with care &nbsp; ✧</span><small>HEARTHROOT CONTROL · ALPHA PREVIEW</small></footer></main><script src="js/diagnostics.js"></script><script src="js/app.js"></script></body></html>
